Source: https://github.com/goshitsarch-eng/GoshLauncher
Comment:
 GoshLauncher is a fork of Ulauncher (https://github.com/Ulauncher/Ulauncher),
 with its launcher UI redesigned to follow Spotlight-goshos
 (https://github.com/goshitsarch-eng/spotlight-goshos). The binary package is
 still named ulauncher because the installed command is still "ulauncher".

